---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Premium Domain Valuation Guide 2026 | What Is sdl.life Worth? | SDL";
const description =
  "How premium domains like sdl.life are valued: length, extension, geo affluence, commercial intent, comps ($18k–$75k), and how to make a winning offer via secure escrow.";
const image =
  "https://imagedelivery.net/-sPAUAWeA405NiWJ0SNIQA/fb0468bf-c79c-4e7f-2d80-3462e61b8b00/public";
const favicon =
  "https://imagedelivery.net/-sPAUAWeA405NiWJ0SNIQA/163edde2-2b98-463b-6627-00612f099e00/public";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  image={image}
  favicon={favicon}
  canonicalPath="/valuation-guide/"
  keywords="domain valuation guide, premium domain worth, how to value a domain, investment domains, expired domains, brandable domains"
>
  <main id="main" class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-slate-200">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-medium text-amber-700 hover:underline">← Back to sdl.life</a>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[2px] text-amber-700">Valuation Guide • Updated 2026</p>
      <h1 class="heading-serif mt-2 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 md:text-5xl dark:text-white">
        What makes sdl.life a premium domain?
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Seven characters, geo-premium prefix, lifestyle-defining extension, and a top-decile market.
        Here’s exactly how sophisticated buyers underwrite it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Scarcity: 3 + 4, pronounceable, exact-meaning</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        SDL = Scottsdale shorthand; life = wellness, longevity, prosperity. Short domains (&lt;8 chars) with
        clear semantics trade at multiples of longer alternatives. There is exactly one sdl.life.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Extension fit: .life beats generic</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        For wellness, 55+ living, and lifestyle media, .life converts intent better than a forced .com.
        Buyers report higher recall and cheaper branded search CPCs on exact-fit extensions.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Market: Scottsdale affluence</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        <li>Median household income $110k+; 56–62% bachelor’s+.</li>
        <li>Median home value $737k–$860k+.</li>
        <li>WalletHub #2 Best Place to Retire (2025).</li>
        <li>Mayo Clinic + world-class wellness tourism demand.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Comps: $18k–$75k</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Publicly reported premium lifestyle / geo .life and .living sales (2023–2026) cluster $18k–$75k
        depending on length and commercial intent. sdl.life is offered at market — serious offers from $25,000.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. How to make a winning offer</h2>
      <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal pl-5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-1">
        <li>State intended use (wellness, 55+, real estate, media…).</li>
        <li>Lead with a serious number (≥ $25k) — lowballs are declined.</li>
        <li>Confirm escrow + timeline (push vs. Auth-code).</li>
        <li>Ask about bundles (sdl.contact, sdl.hair, phx.beauty) for leverage.</li>
      </ol>

      <div class="mt-10 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900 p-8 text-center dark:bg-black dark:border dark:border-white/10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Underwrite it yourself — then own it.</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">Confidential, escrow-protected, 24–48h response.</p>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="/#inquire-offer" class="tap-target inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-white px-8 font-semibold text-slate-900">Make an Offer →</a>
          <a href="/faq/" class="tap-target inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-3xl border border-white/25 px-8 font-semibold text-white">Read buying FAQ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
